  "approval_status": "HOLD",
  "reason": "Official SportAPI documentation lists Serie A and claims Free access to all endpoints and leagues. Its Terms permit use in own websites, apps, analysis and products, while prohibiting raw-data redistribution as a competing feed/API. However, the reviewed Terms do not expressly confirm model training or private raw-response retention; upstream rights and field-level provenance are not identified. The OpenAPI team-statistics schema contains no corner fields, and the documented event families do not establish corner counts. Six of the frozen 19 V2 features therefore remain unsupported. Fixture updated_at is UTC, but its source-observation/correction semantics are not documented. Do not create an account, ingest, infer or evaluate until written rights, full 19-feature coverage and provenance are confirmed.",
